  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6102.08 Safe boater education certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6102.08 “Safe boater education certificate” means a document issued by the division certifying that the person named on the card has established proof of competency and is authorized to operate a boat in New Hampshire pursuant to RSA 270-D:13.\n\nSource. #7650, eff 2-20-02; ss by #9472, eff 5-18-09; ss by #12467, eff 1-25-18",
